# M3 gate: the mouse reaches every System menu action (§6.3).
# Pulldown geometry at 80x24: x=1 y=1 w=20 h=12; item rows: About=2, sep=3,
# Macros=4, Filer=5, Calculator=6, Calendar/Diary=7, sep=8, ASCII=9, sep=10,
# Help=11. Each action opens its dialog (Esc closes) and traces a line into
# the Command window scrollback.
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 2 1
mouse release 3 2 1
key esc
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 4 1
mouse release 3 4 1
key esc
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 5 1
mouse release 3 5 1
key esc
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 6 1
mouse release 3 6 1
key esc
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 7 1
mouse release 3 7 1
key esc
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 9 1
mouse release 3 9 1
key esc
mouse press 2 0 1
mouse release 2 0 1
mouse press 3 11 1
mouse release 3 11 1
key esc
eof
